@startuml SEQ_07_KONFIRMASI_PASSWORD
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-07 · Konfirmasi Password\nAktor: Admin / Asisten / Kadep / Praktikan

actor       "Pengguna"                    as Pengguna
boundary    "Browser"                     as Browser
control     "ConfirmablePasswordController" as Controller
entity      "User Model"                  as Model
database    "users"                       as DB

note over Controller
  Middleware: auth
  Digunakan saat pengguna mencoba mengakses
  halaman/aksi sensitif yang memerlukan
  konfirmasi ulang password (misal: ubah pengaturan keamanan).
  Konfirmasi disimpan di session selama periode tertentu.
end note

== Skenario A: Tampil Halaman Konfirmasi Password ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Akses halaman/aksi yang memerlukan konfirmasi
Browser -> Controller  : GET /confirm-password [middleware: auth]\n(name: password.confirm)
Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Auth/ConfirmPassword')
Browser --> Pengguna   : Tampil form konfirmasi password

== Skenario B: Submit Konfirmasi Password ==

Pengguna -> Browser    : Masukkan password aktif → klik Konfirmasi
Browser -> Controller  : POST /confirm-password [middleware: auth]\n{password}
Controller -> Model    : Auth::guard('web')->validate({\nemail: $request->user()->email,\npassword: $request->password\n})
Model -> DB            : SELECT password FROM users WHERE email = ?
DB --> Model           : hashed password
Model -> Model         : Hash::check(password, hashed_password)
alt Password Salah
  Model --> Controller : false
  Controller --> Browser : ValidationException\n{password: 'auth.password'}
  Browser --> Pengguna   : Tampil pesan "Password yang Anda masukkan salah"
else Password Benar
  Model --> Controller  : true
  Controller -> Controller : $request->session()\n->put('auth.password_confirmed_at', time())
  note right of Controller
    Timestamp konfirmasi disimpan di session.
    Akses ke halaman sensitif diizinkan
    selama interval tertentu (default: 3 jam)
    tanpa perlu konfirmasi ulang.
  end note
  Controller --> Browser : redirect()->intended(route('dashboard'))
  Browser --> Pengguna   : Redirect ke halaman tujuan semula
end

@enduml
